{"id":"vod_md_4324","vodId":"4324","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"调教咖啡厅","name_cn":"调教咖啡厅","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230906-1/cb9fbe4684b64c9797fc67aee75d8738.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一间看似普通的咖啡厅里，在这里工作的服务生们，每个人都有属于他们独特的属性，而他们在工作期间所要完成的任务，就是尽力的去扮演符合自己属性的角色，做出相对应的言行，令特殊的顾客群体感到满意。樱之宫莓香（和气杏未 配音）是一个个性安静而又礼貌的女孩，可是，让她没有想到的是，她被分配到的属性竟然是“抖S”。在扮演抖S的过程中，莓香的某些隐藏特质似乎被激发了。除了莓香外，在咖啡店工作的还有傲娇娘日向夏帆（鬼头明里 配音）、扮演妹妹角色的星川麻冬（春野杏 配音）、看似人气偶像实为伪娘的神崎日照（徳井青空 配音）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-06 08:16:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/a0wMjkpH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/GSRdB6LR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/W2dlgffy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/N4WBIgRZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/5WLn0RsX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/UxfPATco/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/V2hL8Y5Y/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/Jx6vyNsN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/Mtv0F0Qx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/XiJ5DEKr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/5AizE1ie/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/Qrxo4Rt2/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:12.987Z"}